This assertion is related to the comment "@@@ The last index return value must be smaller than the array size".
--------------------
Debug.Assert(OLD(_items.Length) <= ArrayList.MaxArrayLength);
</code>

This is because `LastIndexOf` method returns the last index of a specific value in the array and it uses the `Array.LastIndexOf` method to perform the search. The length of the array, which is the number of elements in the array, could be larger than `MaxArrayLength`, leading to potential issues with runtime.
